<title>USA: Park Electrochemical chooses new CEO.</title>
<headline>Park Electrochemical chooses new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Park Electrochemical Corp said its board of directors had elected Brian Shore as the company's chief executive officer, replacing Jerry Shore who will continue as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Park Electrochemical is a designer and producer of advanced electronic materials used to make multilayer printed circuit boards, semiconductor packages and interconnection systems.</p>
